# At the market in Russian: хлеб, сыр, рыба
subtitle: "Buy bread, cheese and fish at a Russian market with да́йте, пожа́луйста, and say the price right: рубль, рубля́ or рубле́й."
teaches: ["vocabulary/food-and-drink","phrases/prices","grammar/counting-nouns"]
thumb: "band \"Three words for 'rouble'\" note \"1 · 2–4 · 5+\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"What time is it in Russian: который час?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/26-russian-time.cast"}

