    card title "At the market: ры́нок"

A: How do you buy food at a Russian market, a ры́нок, and understand what it costs?
    draw f_bread f_cheese f_fish f_meat f_apple parallel true

B: Here's what's on the stall. Хлеб, bread; and сыр, cheese.
    draw w_hleb w_syr

B: Ры́ба, fish; мя́со, meat; and я́блоко, an apple.
    draw w_ryba w_myaso w_yabloko

A: Many apples are я́блоки, with и: an odd one, since оно́ words in о mostly take а, like о́кна.
    draw w_yabloki f_apple2 f_apple3 f_apple4

    erase f_apple2 f_apple3 f_apple4 w_yabloki

A: To buy, you could say хоч (@draw b_hochu b_x b_daite@)у́, I want; but at a stall, people say да́йте, пожа́луйста: give me, please.

B: Да́йте хлеб. Да́йте ры́бу.
    draw b_hleb b_rybu

A: Hear that? Р (@draw b_rule@)ы́ба became ры́бу: lesson fourteen's object ending, а turns into у, as in я ви́жу ма́му.

A: Хлеб, сыр, мя́со and я́блоко don't end in а, so they stay  (@draw b_rest@)as they are: да́йте сыр, да́йте мя́со.

    erase pageAB

A: Next, the price. In lesso (@draw c_100 c_h1 c_h2 c_h3@)n sixteen you heard сто рубле́й, and I promised the word changes after a number ending in one to four.

B: Оди́н рубль: one rouble, the plain word.
    draw c_r1

A: After two, three or four, it ends in я: два рубля́, три рубля́, четы́ре рубля́.
    draw c_r2

B: After anything else, five to twenty, сто or пятьдеся́т, it's рубле́й, ending in ей, the form you already know.
    draw c_r3

A: For a bigger number, listen to its last word: два́дцать оди́н рубль, два́дцать два рубля́, два́дцать пять рубле́й.
    draw c_d21 c_x21 c_d22 c_x22 c_d25 c_x25

A: But a teen is one word: оди́ннадцать is not оди́н, and двена́дцать is not два, so eleven to fourteen take рубле́й too.
    draw c_x11

    erase c_x11

    draw c_43

    ask "Со́рок три: which word comes next? Tap it." choose ["c_r1","c_r2","c_r3"] answer c_r2 voice a
        intro: Your turn, before we go shopping.
        right: The last word is три, so рубля́: со́рок три рубля́.
        wrong: Listen to the last word: три.

    erase c_43

    hide board

A: Now Masha's stall. I want bread and fish, so first I ask the price.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name s_bread s_fish parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Ско́лько сто́ит хлеб?","gloss":"Hello! How much is the bread?"},{"by":"b","text":"Со́рок оди́н рубль.","gloss":"Forty-one roubles."},{"by":"a","text":"А ры́ба?","gloss":"And the fish?"},{"by":"b","text":"Девяно́сто два рубля́.","gloss":"Ninety-two roubles."},{"by":"a","text":"Да́йте хлеб и ры́бу.","gloss":"Give me bread and fish."},{"by":"b","text":"Пожа́луйста! Сто три́дцать три рубля́.","gloss":"Here you are! 133 roubles."}] size 1.4

    draw talk

    draw s_t41

A: Со́рок оди́н ends in оди́н, so it's рубль, even for forty-one.
    highlight talk_2_words part рубль color #f2c14e

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw s_t92

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw s_t133

B: Сто три́дцать три ends in три, so it takes рубля́.
    highlight talk_6_words part "три рубля́" color #f2c14e

    erase talk

    hide people

    icon q_fish size 180 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish

    quiz "Да́йте, пожа́луйста, ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Да́йте ры́бу." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, from memory, then your score.
        right: After да́йте, the а of ры́ба turns into у.
        wrong: Think of lesson fourteen: after да́йте, what happens to the а of ры́ба?
        * ры́ба
        + ры́бу
        * ры́бы

    erase q_fish question_2_stamp

    text q_22 "22 ₽" #3d3833 x 500 y 470 font_size 130

    quiz "Два́дцать два ___. Which word for roubles?" reveal.text "два́дцать два рубля́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The last word is два, so рубля́.
        wrong: Listen to the last word of the number.
        * рубль
        + рубля́
        * рубле́й

    erase q_22 question_3_stamp

    text q_12 "12 ₽" #3d3833 x 500 y 470 font_size 130

    quiz "Двена́дцать ___. Which word for roubles?" reveal.text "двена́дцать рубле́й" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Twelve is one word, not два, so it takes рубле́й, like every teen.
        wrong: Двена́дцать is a teen: one word, not два.
        * рубль
        * рубля́
        + рубле́й

    erase q_12 question_4_stamp

    icon q_bread size 180 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["baguette bread"] icon_look picture of bread

    ask "Type the Russian for bread." answer ["хлеб"] reveal.text хлеб reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Хлеб: and after да́йте it stays хлеб.
        wrong: Four letters, starting with х.

    erase q_bread question_5_stamp

    text q_1 "1 ₽" #3d3833 x 500 y 470 font_size 130

    ask "Type one rouble in Russian, in two words." answer ["один рубль","1 рубль","рубль"] reveal.text "оди́н рубль" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Оди́н рубль: after оди́н, the plain word.
        wrong: Two words: one, then the plain word for rouble.

    erase q_1 question_6_stamp

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So the price's last word picks the rouble: оди́н, рубль; два, три or четы́ре, рубля́; any other word, рубле́й.
    highlight c_r1 c_r2 c_r3 color #f2c14e

    hide board

B: Да́йте, пожа́луйста, хлеб и ры́бу! Next time: the clock, where hours count just like roubles. Пока́!
    icon e_bread size 160 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["baguette bread"] icon_look picture of bread
    icon e_fish size 160 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish
